#. STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.EGGS_ABOVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.EGGS_ABOVE"
msgid "Bit 2 sends a <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> if there are more than <b>{0}</b> tracked <style=\"KKeyword\">Eggs</style> in the room"
msgstr "방에 추적 중인 <style=\"KKeyword\">알</style>이 <b>{0}</b> 초과이면 비트 2가 <b><style=\"logic_on\">녹색 신호</style></b>를 보냅니다"

#. STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.EGGS_BELOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.EGGS_BELOW"
msgid "Bit 2 sends a <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> if there are fewer than <b>{0}</b> tracked <style=\"KKeyword\">Eggs</style> in the room"
msgstr "방에 추적 중인 <style=\"KKeyword\">알</style>이 <b>{0}</b> 미만이면 비트 2가 <b><style=\"logic_on\">녹색 신호</style></b>를 보냅니다"

#. STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.EXPANDER_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.EXPANDER_TOOLTIP"
msgid "Show or hide the list of types to count"
msgstr "셀 종류 목록을 표시하거나 숨깁니다"

#. STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.MODE_COMBINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.MODE_COMBINED"
msgid "Combined"
msgstr "통합"

#. STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.MODE_COMBINED_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MULTICHANNEL_CRITTER_SENSOR_SIDE_SCREEN.MODE_COMBINED_TOOLTIP"
msgid "One threshold for critters and eggs together. Bit 1 sends a <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> when the combined count passes it."
msgstr "크리터와 알에 하나의 임계값을 함께 적용합니다. 합산한 수가 임계값을 넘으면 비트 1이 <b><style=\"logic_on\">녹색 신호</style></b>를 보냅니다."

